  "summary": {
    "ja": [
      "動画の時間と範囲を指す注釈（target が #t=…&xywh=…）の見本。ArchiveBase の Video Search が AI で検出した人の枠 125 件のうち、目で確かめて確かに人が写っている 27 件だけを残し、IIIF の注釈に書き直した。枠は AI の出力のまま。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Sample of annotations on a time and a region of a video (target #t=…&xywh=…). ArchiveBase Video Search found 125 boxes of people with AI; a person checked each one by eye, and only the 27 that really show a person are kept here, rewritten as IIIF annotations. The boxes are the AI output as is."
    ]
  },
